# Keep secrets and bulky/irrelevant files out of the Docker build context. The
# images are pushed to a PUBLIC registry, and `COPY . .` in the Dockerfiles
# would otherwise pull all of this into the build context (and the builder
# layer), one careless COPY or --cache-to away from being published.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Real database dumps live here and contain real user data / password hashes.
backups/

.git
.github
.gitignore
docs/
.superpowers/
*.md

# Local tooling / editor noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
